<p>Beskriv et konkret angrebsscenarie for hvert fund. Sandsynlighed går fra 1 (lav) til 5 (høj).</p>
<p>Ved skift af teknik erstattes fundets Controls med den nye tekniks katalogforslag.</p>
<section>
<h2>ATT&amp;CK-fund</h2>
<form id="threat-form">
<input type="hidden" name="id">
<label>Systemasset<select name="systemAssetId" required>
</select>
</label>
<label>ATT&amp;CK-teknik<select name="attackTechniqueId" required>
</select>
</label>
<div id="technique-info">
</div>
<label>Scenarie<textarea name="scenario" required>
</textarea>
</label>
<label>Sandsynlighed<input name="likelihood" type="number" min="1" max="5" value="1" required>
</label>
<button>Gem fund</button>
<button type="reset">Annuller redigering</button>
</form>
</section>
<div id="threat-list">
</div>
